message: "If you cite the Vector Lab, please use the metadata below."
title: "Vector Lab: Research Instruments for the Vector Medium"
abstract: >-
  Vector Lab is a suite of research instruments for working with the geometry
  of large language models, embedding spaces, and theoretical corpora. The hub
  site links to each instrument's own documentation and sets the shared design
  and conventions.
type: software
